Template: tacacsrs-agentd/config-source
Type: select
Choices: sonic-configdb, unset
Default: unset
Description: Which configuration source should tacacsrs-agentd record?
 This package can record package-managed defaults for the tacacsrs-agentd
 installation profile in /etc/tacacsrs-agentd/config.ini.
 .
 Choose sonic-configdb for a SONiC deployment that should source TACACS+
 configuration from CONFIG_DB. Choose unset to leave the package profile in a
 neutral state for later manual configuration.

Template: tacacsrs-agentd/install-sonic-service
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Enable the SONiC tacacsrs-agentd systemd service?
 If enabled, the package will configure and enable tacacsrs-agentd.service so
 the daemon starts automatically using the SONiC ConfigDB-backed service unit.
 .
 You can change this later with dpkg-reconfigure tacacsrs-agentd.